{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110529","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110529/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110529/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110529/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110529","id":3417888716,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7LuNfM","number":110529,"title":"`Clip Only` Masks exhibit opaque black background at runtime with transparent window","user":{"login":"CookieBadger","id":53947784,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzOTQ3Nzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53947784?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger","html_url":"https://github.com/CookieBadger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CookieBadger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-15T13:05:23Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T14:34:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.1.stable (Compatibility Renderer)\nAlso 4.4.3.stable, and 4.2.2.stable according to #98882\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, Godot 4.4.1.stable, Compatibility\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `clip_children` property seems to set the opacity of the screen texture to 1.0 (not noticeable in the editor, since the background is always drawn).\n\n<img width=\"1409\" height=\"982\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91934278-39ed-4ea0-8586-3059f9209ce7\" />\n\nNot sure if this issue only applies to Compatibility or to Forward as well, since transparent windows don't work on my sytem in Forward (#76167).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create new Project in Compatibility Rendering mode\n- Enable `display/window/size/transparent` and `display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed`\n- Create a Control node that draws a mask (e.g. ColorRect) and set `clip_children` to Clip Only\n- Create a Control node as a child of the mask that draws something (e.g. TextureRect with Godot Icon)\n- Have the mask node be a larger than its child\n- Run the scene and observe a black border around the rect that you are drawing \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[cliponly_transparency_bug_MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22337370/cliponly_transparency_bug_MRP.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110529/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110529/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}